---
---

<section id="como-funciona" aria-labelledby="como-titulo">
  <div class="container facil">
    <header class="facil__encabezado">
      <h2 id="como-titulo">Así de fácil</h2>
      <p>Del monto al aviso de pago, en tres pasos.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="facil__pasos">
      <li class="facil__paso reveal">
        <div class="facil__cara">
          <span class="facil__icono" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5"></path>
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M6 10.2V20h12v-9.8"></path>
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M10 20v-5h4v5"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div class="facil__texto">
            <h3>1. Arma la venta</h3>
            <p>Escribe el monto; el concepto y la referencia son opcionales.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="facil__paso reveal">
        <div class="facil__cara">
          <span class="facil__icono" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M5 5h5.2v5.2H5zM13.8 5H19v5.2h-5.2zM5 13.8h5.2V19H5z"></path>
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M13.8 13.8H16v2.2h-2.2zM17 13.8h2V16h-2zM13.8 17H16v2h-2.2zM17 17h2v2h-2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div class="facil__texto">
            <h3>2. Tu cliente paga</h3>
            <p>Escanea el QR con la app de su banco o recibe la notificación de cobro.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="facil__paso reveal">
        <div class="facil__cara">
          <span class="facil__icono" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle
                cx="12"
                cy="12"
                r="8"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"></circle>
              <path
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="m8.4 12.2 2.4 2.4 4.8-5.1"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div class="facil__texto">
            <h3>3. Te avisamos</h3>
            <p>Verás "¡Te pagaron!" con el monto en cuanto llega el pago.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #como-funciona {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .facil {
    padding-block: var(--space-16);
  }

  .facil__encabezado {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .facil__encabezado h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .facil__encabezado p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--type-cuerpo-l-size);
    line-height: var(--type-cuerpo-l-line);
  }

  .facil__pasos {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .facil__paso {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .facil__paso:nth-child(1) {
    transition-delay: 0ms;
  }

  .facil__paso:nth-child(2) {
    transition-delay: 120ms;
  }

  .facil__paso:nth-child(3) {
    transition-delay: 240ms;
  }

  .facil__cara {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    height: 100%;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--outline-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-1);
  }

  .facil__icono {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--primary-container);
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .facil__icono svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .facil__texto {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .facil__texto h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--type-titulo-2-size);
    line-height: var(--type-titulo-2-line);
    font-weight: var(--type-titulo-2-weight);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .facil__texto p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--type-cuerpo-size);
    line-height: var(--type-cuerpo-line);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .facil__pasos {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }

    .facil__pasos::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 0;
      top: calc(var(--space-6) + 28px);
      left: 12%;
      right: 12%;
      height: 2px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: var(--primary);
      opacity: 0.35;
      transform: scaleX(1);
      transform-origin: left center;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .facil__paso {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) and (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .facil__pasos::before {
      animation: trazo-pasos 1.05s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.15s both;
    }
  }

  @keyframes trazo-pasos {
    from {
      transform: scaleX(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .facil__cara {
      transition: transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 220ms ease;
    }

    .facil__paso:hover .facil__cara {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--elev-3);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .facil__cara,
    .facil__pasos::before {
      animation: none;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
